  "solution": {
    "text": "Distance = area under the graph\n$\\begin{aligned}\nd & =300 \\times 2+400 \\times 28.5 \\\\\n& =600+114000 \\\\\n& =12000 \\mathrm{~m}\n\\end{aligned}$",
